  "releaseNotes": "2.6.0\n\t\t  Improved HTTP client performance\n\t\t  2.5.1\n\t\t  Exposed method to clear certificate cache\n\t\t  2.5.0\n\t\t  Implemented new certificate loading from cache to avoid loading from disk every time\n\t\t  2.4.3\n\t\t  Fix loading cert as exportable only\n\t\t  2.4.2\n\t\t  Load cert usingin machinekeys and persist keys (not efemeral)\n\t\t  2.4.0\n\t\t  Added Project Reference for eInvoice\n\t\t  2.3.2\n\t\t  version bump to fix signature problems with consuming code\n\t\t  2.3.1\n\t\t  Improve Certificate loading and handling with proper dispose\n\t\t  2.3.0\n\t\t  Added Register BU endpoint to register business units\n\t\t  2.2.0\n\t\t  Removed dependency on SimpleFileLogger\n\t\t  2.1.4\n\t\t  Return code if faultcode is null\n\t\t  2.1.3\n\t\t  Marked Verification Link in Invoice Type with [XMLIgnore] to avoid serialization\n\t\t  2.1.2\n\t\t  Made utils internal\n\t\t  2.1.1\n\t\t  Changed logging to default disabled if no configuration is present\n\t\t  2.1.0\n\t\t  Initial support for nuget packaging\n\t\t  Better handling of HTTP requests by using static HttpClient\n\t\t  Made HTTP Client fully async.\n\t\t  2.0.0\n\t\t  Use Fiscalisation objects directly without parsing them to your own objects.\n\t\t  Added support for Net 8.0\n\t\t  Updated PackageReferences\n\t\t  Changed GetTaxpayersResponse to GetTaxpayer.\n\t\t  1.9.2\n\t\t  Fixed TotPrice formatting causing wrong IIC. Added file logger to IICBuilder\n\t\t  1.9.1\n\t\t  Fix datetime truncate for consistent IIC builds. Made kind = local explicitly\n\t\t  1.9.0\n\t\t  Print SuplyDateOrPeriod\n\t\t  1.8.0\n\t\t  Added invoice extentions for printing info in receipts\n\t\t  1.7.5\n\t\t  Added exchange info to eInvoice in foreign currency\n\t\t  1.7.4\n\t\t  Fixed currency issues in eInvoice due to bad string format\n\t\t  1.7.3\n\t\t  use Result for response to revert async posting as was casuing problems with concurrency in Resto\n\t\t  1.7.2\n\t\t  use Await for response when posting to make it async\n\t\t  1.7.1\n\t\t  fix VR for tax_free items. Shorten QR\n\t\t  1.7.0\n\t\t  Add taxpoint date\n\t\t  1.6.1\n\t\t  Add Fisk nga IVA to printer. Removed some empty lines\n\t\t  1.6.0\n\t\t  Added QR printing as bitmap\n\t\t  1.5.3\n\t\t  change iic builder total.ToString(#.00)\n\t\t  1.5.2\n\t\t  fix tax in valute\n\t\t  1.5.1\n\t\t  fix validation url for selfIssuing\n\t\t  1.5.0\n\t\t  Add invoice period\n\t\t  1.4.1\n\t\t  Fix tax = null when issuer not in VAT. Fix Vat category FRE when seller or buyer not in VAT\n\t\t  1.4.0\n\t\t  Add currency for eInvoice. Add docType to eInvoiceExt\n\t\t  1.3.0\n\t\t  add FIC to paymentMeans PaymentID as payment identifier\n\t\t  1.2.1\n\t\t  Fix Header for WTN Response\n\t\t  1.2.0\n\t\t  Adds PaymentDueDate to PaymentMeans in eInvoiceExt\n\t\t  1.1.0\n\t\t  Adds suport for eInvoice Extentions to accomdate payment means",
  "repository": "",
  "verbatimVersion": "2.6.0",
